      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Likelihood functions for detecting QTLs using marker information in sets of sibs follow by suitable modifications of those developed for complex segregation analysis (Chapter 13). Recall that to construct the latter, the likelihood for an individual with trait value $ z_{o} $ is computed by first obtaining the likelihood conditional on the QTL genotypes of its parents ( $ Q_{s} $ for the sire and $ Q_{d} $ for the dam),",
