    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "where the transmission probabilities $ p(Q_o \\mid M_o, M_s, M_d, Q_s, Q_d) $ are functions of the marker genotypes of the offspring $ (M_o) $ and its parents $ (M_s, M_d) $. Averaging over all possible parental genotypes gives",
