    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "In a similar fashion, the likelihood function for any pedigree can (in principle) be computed by suitably conditioning on the genotypes of parents and other relatives.",
      "source_page": 522,
      "printed_page": 502,
      "source_block_ids": [
        "Genetics_chapter16:p018:b8"
      ],
      "bbox": [
        120.0,
